			title: "Strands, Rotors and Targets"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 17.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B0561CB951B62B9"]
			description: ["The &6Ion Implanter&r, &6MOCVD Reactor&r, &6Zone Refining Tower&r, &6Synchrotron&r, &6Crystal Growth Furnace&r and &6Photonic Foundry&r take rows for oxide crystals, etched stacks, seven-nines tellurium and germanium, a charged beam and the MESO die. The UV and UHV controllers you already own, and the new purities. The substrates, the spintronic dies and the mainframe's inputs. Boules and films by bus; recycle what the tower rejects."]
			icon: "gtceu:photonic_foundry"
			id: "117C9D11A0595525"
