		}
		{
			dependencies: ["71359F03B137FB0B"]
			description: ["The &6Calutron&r, &6Heavy Ion Cyclotron&r, &6Recoil Separator&r, &6Superheavy Chemistry Lab&r, &6Electron Beam Furnace&r, &6Megabar Press&r, &6CVI Furnace&r and &6Photonic Integration Hall&r each take a UXV row: targets, elements 121 and 122, pure metals, boron nitride, a tungsten preform and the spintronic mainframe. The UEV controllers you already own. Census III, the Mk6 casing and the mainframe. Recoils and targets by bus. The spent beam is an output, so route it."]
			icon: "gtceu:calutron"
